<title>USA: Lucent, GTE, Bell Atlantic, ATT win Navy contract.</title>
<headline>Lucent, GTE, Bell Atlantic, ATT win Navy contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Navy said on Tuesday it had awarded a $2.934 billion contract to Lucent Technologies Inc, GTE Government Systems Corp, Bell Atlantic Federal Integrated Systems Inc and AT&amp;T Government Markets.</p>
<p>The contract is for voice, video and data modernization of the Navy's base level infrastructure.</p>
<p>The contract is expected to be completed by July 2007.</p>
<p>((--Washington Newsroom 202 898-8300))</p>
</text>
